# Source documents stay local unless you choose to track them (SCS 0.7, D-59). An SCD's
# derived_from still names the document; the compiler never reads sources/. Each sources/
# README says what goes there, so it is tracked (D-86).
**/sources/*
!**/sources/README.md

# dist/ holds compiled artifacts. Version commits leave it out either way; ignore it here too if
# you do not want artifacts in the repository.

